      "id": "text_ZlhkNioNqQv2g4qO",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Ontdek de ongelofelijke </p><p>succesverhalen van onze klanten.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_l9ejWqok3f1uYyGJ",
      "label": "Quote",
      "default": "<p><em>Absoluut een game-changer!</em></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_4cxJ2pHQ7EbehvBm",
      "label": "Quote",
      "default": "<p>3 maanden nicotinevrij dankzij Lio! De klantenservice was uitzonderlijk. Ik ben dankbaar voor dit product op mijn reis om te stoppen met roken💪</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_ts8UhfiVvb6VekTJ",
      "label": "Name",
      "default": "<p>Sofie (5 dagen geleden)</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_Jci5yFGCGCi1aXis",
      "label": "Quote",
      "default": "<p><em>Simpel en effectief!</em></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_kmMGp0XEQFC1PGur",
      "label": "Quote",
      "default": "<p>Na een week Lio te hebben gebruikt, voel ik al het verschil. Geen rook, geen nicotine, gewoon iets om mijn handen bezig te houden zonder schuldgevoel. Een echte levensredder!</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_dMb1SFR8PB06pr7a",
      "label": "Name",
      "default": "<p>Zakaria Ernst (23 Nov 2024)</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_eUJmsrDOspmgeSzc",
      "label": "Quote",
      "default": "<p>Een eenvoudige manier </p><p>om te stoppen</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_l3Quctl1aEvlL0mI",
      "label": "Quote",
      "default": "<p>Ik gebruik dit product nu bijna een week, en wat een waanzinnig goed idee was dat. Hoewel het heel moeilijk is om te stoppen met vapen, deed dit product dat met de meeste eenvoud. Zegen jullie allemaal.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_7mvxPECJvpl3BS8i",
      "label": "Name",
      "default": "<p>Amr (1 Oct 2024)</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_GjZ37hgpolp8sT3a",
      "label": "Quote",
      "default": "<p>Ik ben gestopt na 35 jaar</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_B0BlXa2eDKYOjela",
      "label": "Quote",
      "default": "<p>Nadat ik mijn collega met zijn Lio had gezien, waagde ik de sprong. Ik was al 35 jaar een roker en stoppen was een hel. Met Lio spreekt het voor zich, hoewel ik het huis niet uitga zonder.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_NL7BF5zArqiQxG5f",
      "label": "Name",
      "default": "<p>Koen (2 May 2024)</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_hUN1aSX1WkZluyPA",
      "label": "Quote",
      "default": "<p><em>Geweldig product</em></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_1sJLrh277s6u0VyK",
      "label": "Quote",
      "default": "<p>74 dagen rookvrij dankzij Lio! . Dit is een fantastisch hulpmiddel voor iedereen die wil stoppen met roken. Een echte aanrader!</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_IdHzSt695PlNZp5k",
      "label": "Name",
      "default": "<p>Noëlle Huizer (17 Nov 2024)</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_MSAFcVyZCSqJIGh7",
      "label": "Quote",
      "default": "<p>Helpt mij om van de sigaretten af ​​te blijven!</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_InBbd7XkgR92lYWX",
      "label": "Quote",
      "default": "<p>Lio is een uitstekende vervanging. Ik was mijn diffuser kwijt, maar ze stuurden snel een vervanging - geweldig product en service!</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_CWoK5kP6NYZYrcb6",
      "label": "Name",
      "default": "<p>Josje (4 dagen geleden)</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_Ol40FqPkcJ7UmJNS",
      "label": "Quote",
      "default": "<p>Geweldige, snelle service!</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_S0sMzpQ1RrYAPKVO",
      "label": "Quote",
      "default": "<p>Kreeg snelle en vriendelijke hulp toen mijn pakket beschadigd aankwam. Het probleem werd vlot opgelost—uitstekende klantenservice!</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_El2K676Kn0zwjOy2",
      "label": "Name",
      "default": "<p>Stefan Blokzijl (1 dag geleden)</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_gsGXu4Gzf38V91NQ",
      "label": "Quote",
      "default": "<p>Lio heeft mijn leven gered</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_VwwUvjWbmmt7kXvv",
      "label": "Quote",
      "default": "<p>Ik rookte bijna 60 sigaretten per dag. Ik heb veel dure manieren geprobeerd om te stoppen met roken, maar helaas zonder resultaat. Ik besloot Lio te proberen en na 2 weken gebruik ik alleen dit. Zonder angstcrisis.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_moUVoxTOoAYlGGMA",
      "label": "Name",
      "default": "<p>Pedro (11 Nov 2024)</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_INi0CO5wb0E0azMl",
      "label": "Quote",
      "default": "<p>Ik ben eindelijk gestopt!</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_0MtphL2aJPKCGFye",
      "label": "Quote",
      "default": "<p><em>Ik hou van mijn Lio! Zo blij dat ik eindelijk van de damp af ben na jaren en jaren. Zou het zeker aanraden.</em></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_nQPOB8lYqfsMgdfL",
      "label": "Name",
      "default": "<p>Bridgett (10 Nov 2024)</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_aXeUpzC3OThefeqm",
      "label": "Title",
      "default": "<h3><strong>JIJ VROEG</strong></h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_yrj0UhYXHVwzdTNr",
      "label": "Title",
      "default": "<h3><strong>wij antwoorden</strong></h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_gngl0vjaKMkegaZe",
      "label": "Paragraph",
      "default": "<p><strong>What does flavored air taste like?</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_yI83v1N3oqa5QOQP",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p><strong>If you’re used to vapor, Lio might feel lighter at first—but it’s designed for a healthier future. Think of Lio as herbal tea compared to the sticky soda of vapor: less intense, more natural, and far better for you.</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_usNJgGEkFftgJKyD",
      "label": "Paragraph",
      "default": "<p>Is Lio safe to use?</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_Qo1QlikVQU9MPldx",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p><strong>Lio is made with 100% natural ingredients and is completely free from nicotine, smoke, and harmful chemicals, making it a safe and healthier alternative for people trying to quit smoking or vaping.</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_YcTesLna3PGpB2j5",
      "label": "Paragraph",
      "default": "<p>How does Lio work?</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_jCUp8QZKVtZwIMXf",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p><strong>Lio works by replacing the hand-to-mouth fixation with naturally infused air, offering calming, refreshing flavors without nicotine, smoke, or chemicals. This action helps reduce the psychological need for smoking or vaping while keeping you engaged with familiar habits.</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_s2rhgPWGx7KfQPdZ",
      "label": "Paragraph",
      "default": "<p>How long do the Lio Cores last?</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_gWR85OJ2G56WHjMz",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p><strong>Each Lio Core lasts 2-4 days, depending on your usage. Heavy users may need to replace the cores more frequently, but they are designed to provide lasting flavor and a satisfying experience.</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_aTPo4hAsLQIqs8G0",
      "label": "Paragraph",
      "default": "<p>Shipping &amp; Refunds</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_EZvAChRlpPBvojAo",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p><strong>Worldwide shipping - For Free</strong></p><p>We ship worldwide from the Netherlands with free shipping on all orders. Delivery takes 2-3 days within Europe, 4-8 days outside Europe, and next-day delivery in the Middle East (from Dubai).</p><p></p><p><strong>The Money Back Guarantee</strong></p><p>If you’ve used Lio™, commit to a 30 days to experience its benefits. After completing the 30-day journey, you have 7 days to request a refund if you’re not satisfied. This ensures you have enough time to fully explore its impact before making a decision.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_cLc5kXVY2SeZ9uPZ",
      "label": "Paragraph",
      "default": "<p>Can I use Lio anywhere?</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_4JGxyCUyhCxU9ton",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p><strong>Yes! Lio produces no smoke, vapor, or harmful chemicals, so it can be used in most places where smoking or vaping are not allowed. Its discreet and clean design makes it a convenient, portable option to carry and use anywhere, whether you’re at home, work, or on the go.</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_SrvpTADgKiIlgK4C",
      "label": "Paragraph",
      "default": "<p>What are cores made of?</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_1eH5grFhPFIkhbkl",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Each Core fiber is medical grade polyester, infused in the fiber is our unique plant blend of pure essential oils from amazing farms we&apos;ve partnered with around the world.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_Kxqy4aUWYkYcOwlX",
      "label": "Paragraph",
      "default": "<p>How often can I use Lio?</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_a8RitR9ig8kuu0SS",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p><strong>Use Lio as often as you like. If you experience any discomfort, please discontinue use and consult your physician.</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_4FR0Zbqn27ZvfPYo",
      "label": "Title",
      "default": "<h3><strong>wij zijn trots op</strong></h3>"
